{"4639980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Light On", "steam_appid": 4639980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639980/extras/6359a85193f6df4f35469b8e5afd9c69.poster.avif?t=1777194948\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639980/extras/6359a85193f6df4f35469b8e5afd9c69.webm?t=1777194948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639980/extras/6359a85193f6df4f35469b8e5afd9c69.mp4?t=1777194948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Light On is a tactical shooter designed to deliver a deeply immersive, story-driven experience. Players will encounter layered dialogue, fresh gameplay mechanics, difficult ethical choices, and a distinctive shooting system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whats the story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a police officer in a city that no longer feels alive. The streets are quieter than they should be—not because there is peace, but because something has gone terribly wrong. Crime has spread like a disease, growing faster than anyone can control, leaving the city fractured and its communities abandoned. Your job is to take control of all the crime happening in this city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4639980/extras/6359a85193f6df4f35469b8e5afd9c69.poster.avif?t=1777194948\" width=600 height=